                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-percentage"></i>
                            <h5>Low Rates</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i>
                            <h5>Flexible Terms</h5>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-building"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Business Loans</h3>
                    <div class="service-image" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-b413da4baf72?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80');"></div>
                    <p>Capital for your business expansion, equipment purchase, or working capital needs.</p>
                    
                    <div class="loan-details">
                        <h4>Loan Details</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Loan Amount: $20,000 - $500,000</li>
