                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="loan-features">
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                            <h5>Growth Capital</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
                            <h5>Equipment Financing</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd"></i>
                            <h5>Working Capital</h5>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Home Renovation Loans</h3>
                    <div class="service-image" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545324418-cc1a3fa10c00?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80');"></div>
                    <p>Transform your living space with our specialized home renovation financing options.</p>
                    
                    <div class="loan-details">
                        <h4>Loan Details</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Loan Amount: Up to $80,000</li>
                            <li>Interest Rate: 4.0% - 7.0% p.a.</li>
                            <li>Term: 1 - 5 years</li>
                            <li>Flexible repayment options</li>
                            <li>Quick disbursement</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="loan-features">
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-paint-roller"></i>
                            <h5>Renovation</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
                            <h5>Home Improvement</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-couch"></i>
                            <h5>Furniture</h5>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">
